{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ladies of <i>Kappa Kappa Tease</i> are spiraling since learning their sorority house is haunted! It's probably just a rumor, but now it's your job to keep them feeling safe and secure. As you cycle through the security cameras, keep your eyes peeled for anything that seems out of the ordinary (whether it's a missing object, or a shadow getting jiggy) and use your on-screen report panel   to make them go away. But be careful; false reports or too many weird things active at once will end your night early!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Static cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 paranormal anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On screen UI anomaly reporting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly report feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty and accessibility adjustments\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark humor</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sigma Ghoul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026460/e8c7743f03dbb4d6c73afdcc4a2bfcf9267b42da.jpg"},{"name":"Gaslight, Gatekeep, Girlboss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026460/e8c7743f03dbb4d6c73afdcc4a2bfcf9267b42da.jpg"},{"name":"Alpha Grindset","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026460/e8c7743f03dbb4d6c73afdcc4a2bfcf9267b42da.jpg"},{"name":"Can\u2019t Sit With Us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026460/e8c7743f03dbb4d6c73afdcc4a2bfcf9267b42da.jpg"},{"name":"Vape Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026460/e8c7743f03dbb4d6c73afdcc4a2bfcf9267b42da.jpg"},{"name":"Final Girl Energy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati